msgctxt "120"
msgid "Aw, are you scared? If you don't wanna die, then pay up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Have mercy! I didn't do anything to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but your luck ran out when you crossed my path.\r\n"
"Pay up now if you want me to let you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"(That must be the hitman Kotaro. I better put a stop\r\n"
"to this before it gets out of hand.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Huh? What do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "You lookin' for trouble, old man!? Haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Aaaaaaagh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Hey! Come back here...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Nrgh... Son of a bitch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Anyway, whatever. Seein' as you crashed my party, I hope\r\n"
"you're ready, dickhead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Ready for what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I'm a professional killer. Ain't nobody in the underworld\r\n"
"who hasn't heard about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Uh, actually, I've never heard of you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Haha! You must be a civilian, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "What are ya, a chef or something? Sure are dressed like one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Does this look like a chef's uniform to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Haha! Well, whatever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"But you got the part about me being a professional\r\n"
"killer, right? You freaked out yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Sorry. I don't follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Just gimme your money if you're that scared. That way, you\r\n"
"at least make it out with your life intact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Are you listening to a word I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"You're the Reaper Kotaro, right? What are you\r\n"
"trying to accomplish here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "What!? How come ya know my name!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Did I even tell ya my name!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "No, you didn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Then how'd ya know 'bout me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Why're you talking like that now? You all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "I'm a killer. So cough up some money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Give it up. You're coming with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Aaaaaaagh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
